<title>ESTONIA: FOREKS CORRECTS, RAISES NEW PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>FOREKS CORRECTS, RAISES NEW PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forekspank corrected and raised its profit forecast for 1997 to 96.4 million kroons, an increase of 24.6 million kroons from the forecast issued earlier in the year.</p>
<p>In a new statement, the bank corrected its earlier announcement, which had a forecast of 90.4 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
